{"sessions":[{"session":0,"messages":["Hola, mi nombre is Priya Johnson.","I work at Databricks como researcher.","I live in Berlin, it's a great city for tech.","My birthday is April 18, just a reminder for you.","I have a sister named Nadia Williams.","Please keep my answers short and concise, that's my standing instruction.","I've been at Databricks since April 2024, so almost two years now."],"conveyed":["s0f0","s0f1","s0f2","s0f3","s0f4","s0f5","s0f6"]},{"session":1,"messages":["Hey, I thought I'd share some updates about me.","For coffee, I used to love oat milk lattes pero ahora prefiero espresso straight up.","My music taste changed too, from techno to indie rock, I guess I'm getting old.","I know TypeScript, Swift, and Python - coding languages are my thing when I'm not climbing rocks.","Speaking of, I really enjoy rock climbing in my free time.","Photography is another hobby I picked up lately, it's super relajante."],"conveyed":["s1f0","s1f1","s1f2","s1f3","s1f4","s1f5","s1f6"]},{"session":2,"messages":["Big news! I left Databricks in May 2025.","Then I joined Google in May 2025 as a researcher.","But guess what? I left Google in August 2026 too.","These days I'm working at Vercel, it's been a crazy year switching jobs."],"conveyed":["s2f0","s2f1","s2f2","s2f3"]},{"session":3,"messages":["Just wanted to mention that I moved to Seattle in May 2025.","I was previously living in Berlin, pero Seattle has been a nice change."],"conveyed":["s3f0"]},{"session":4,"messages":["Hey quick update - my manager is Dana.","She manages the Platform team.","The Platform team uses TypeScript, which I'm good at.","I'm on the Platform team now, working closely with Dana."],"conveyed":["s4f0","s4f1","s4f2","s4f3"]},{"session":5,"messages":["Work update: I finished Project Granite in May 2026.","I'm currently working on Project Beacon now.","Before that, I worked on Project Atlas, which I finished in March 2026."],"conveyed":["s5f0","s5f1","s5f2"]},{"session":6,"messages":["Remember that hackathon I organized? It was on July 3, 2025, super fun event.","I also published a blog post recently, on July 24, 2026, check it out if you get the chance."],"conveyed":["s6f0","s6f1"]},{"session":7,"messages":["Cool things that happened recently: I spoke at a conference on November 14, 2025.","Then in January 15, 2026, I ran the marathon, it was exhausting but worth it.","By the way, I've switched to indie rock for music now, just an update."],"conveyed":["s7f0","s7f1","s7f2"]}]}
